            "created_at": "2025-08-27T23:23:34.547358+00:00",
            "notes": "If you opened up this guide only at the start of the match, read the playstyle notes at the top when you have time between rounds.\n\nIf you're confident in your ability to hit your shots without [Super Visor](item_b3db0ab0-26b4-4d99-893d-175f6726c9e9), then [Double Helix](item_808afc07-1398-4962-bf2c-f8e3b74014e3) is probably the better pick. But if that's the case, the rest of this build probably isn't optimal for you anyway.\n\nPick up some damage items, play relatively safe, and try to put out damage where you can to earn cash. Earning as much as you can in the first couple of rounds can help you maintain an advantage on the enemy team as the match progresses, or at least keep yourself from falling behind.",
