            "notes": "[Cratered](item_5bb876bf-52b5-496c-a9ea-b68e72ed3be1) can make it even easier to do more damage consistently and gives you a bit more damage output, but it's not the only good option.\n\nIf you're going up against a Junker Queen (who doesn't have the ability to block or nullify your shots with barriers, bubbles, etc.), if you're facing off against a lot of flyers, or the enemy team doesn't have much else to deal with your auto-aim shots (Genji's deflect, Mei walls, etc.), then [Peripheral Pulse](item_f024f11e-2fff-40cf-9e2d-fbaa21fa1371) can be a strong choice.\n\nIf your team is having trouble taking down barriers from Reinhardt, Sigma, or Orisa (if she took [Shield Divergence](item_6577581c-389a-466b-af28-158e2a11ac37)), then [Salvaged Slugs](item_019d6c60-36eb-42ec-8d6e-5bbb44a0db61) is another item option, but don't feel obligated if you can manage without it. There are usually better choices, but sometimes it can make all the difference. If you go this route, consider picking [Chaingun](item_311b58a8-4cdf-480a-ba7a-0b69e6b77e3d) this round as well.\n\n[Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b) is going to be a huge amount of value if you're able to afford it. For the cost, it gives you a crazy amount of AP that's easy to keep up with Soldier. It's also part of the reason to try to land a few weapon shots before firing your rockets, when you're able.\n\nI also recommend [Mark of the Kitsune](item_09a53e39-25aa-4f66-ba51-bedbc543a1eb) if you chose [Cratered](item_5bb876bf-52b5-496c-a9ea-b68e72ed3be1) as your power. It's going to be the biggest boost to both your burst and sustained damage, especially if you're keeping up with using your rockets on cooldown.\n\nIf you picked up a a weapon-based power ([Chaingun](item_311b58a8-4cdf-480a-ba7a-0b69e6b77e3d) or [Peripheral Pulse](item_f024f11e-2fff-40cf-9e2d-fbaa21fa1371)) instead here, you're probably better off taking an item that will boost your weapon damage more, like:\n- [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) if they have lots of armor\n- [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) if you can afford it\n- [Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f) if the other team has multiple heroes with attack speed to steal\n- [Commander's Clip](item_ff7cad01-2065-4908-a2c1-3bdf1458c7a4) if you went [Chaingun](item_311b58a8-4cdf-480a-ba7a-0b69e6b77e3d)\n- [Aerial Distresser](item_0fcb9020-c729-49b9-b398-3223797b6204) if you're up against multiple flyers.",
